# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
# NOTE: on the `integration/*` branches dist IS committed on purpose. Those
# branches exist to be consumed directly as a git dependency while the upstream
# PRs are in review, and a git install runs no build step (package.json has no
# `prepare` script and `files` publishes only `dist`), so an ignored dist would
# install an empty package. Do not carry this change into develop/main.
# /dist/

